<description>&lt;p&gt;Islamic State militants killed a Christian who refused to renounce Jesus in Libya, while a Libyan study has mapped tuberculosis cases in the south. The Ministry of Justice affirmed its regional branches' commitment to improving the justice system, and UNICEF welcomed Libya's decision to raise the minimum military recruitment age to 18. The FIA Islamabad Zone booked 12 deportees from Libya in a human trafficking case, and Libya's top Islamic authority banned the wearing and selling of Nike products. According to UCDP, there were 2 battle-related deaths in 2024.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxPTlN4Z0NvUnBzSnd0SG9fbUx5Z25Xb19YalJBalpPVHpXZ29BUHJUem9aYTZWZkYwOGZxU1pwRXJvWEMweFhjQ0RIcWcwcHZHdUFIMXRSZHY0ZlZwZXh2bGFvTTJaUTB2OGV4SFdDX3h1YTh0clpIYU1JaWdEMk5LaUVsRlFnbzA2SWhybHR3RGcyemZlZUFj?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxOWkZubmhhQUdVZ1llaDU4VFVPby0zaGl0QzM1a1pEU0w5RmxIVDVmSXlfamZmY0g3blVIWmtuUFdPYTZHZHdMUUNQbEtYazlXdGd1Q0owbjNyS0xmQ3lMVjNRcnpQMEFTOV84ejBlNXh6ekxIal93aWV1ZzY3QS0tekFPTnRGdm42ZzNLdEdhUUhhbF9wd3pGaw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxOVjFWejNpZjAwc0puNlJiS3NGQTZuazVna0hBQkxjcGdyTzVVLXJuVS1DbHY3cFVVZ3JubUNLNWhBLXJmUFl4TGVwRzFLSnZYajFYUWl3MzlGTXBDTXlqbGpENFRKWnpra3owZGJUSHM4M21LV2xJQzJMTnRsWDdkYVZKQmVHT2pQSGwyTFVlbDVjTFozM3JsYlVkSDkxbkVGaEVVYVVTdmxCOGhCdUlCM0E2d1ZhQjF6aTFOTnBB?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxPUEpmTF9SQ2REc3ZTTGE0VVU2VlYyeEFvUGdaY0w0NG9xZThnV1RGTFl1bUd3MG1pTUJwVkw2VXJBYnpSTllmZmoybk1iQl9KeFhpczQ2RjFKaFRLa2k0TDNFLWotcllaWERTby1iWXNfUndpZUVFdU5BSktEaHN1VFhJdDRXRy1INnFYN1NB?oc=5&quot;&gt;DAZN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.